++
++    PASS     exit 0
++    FAIL     exit != 0 (loi test hoac loi chay)
++    SKIPPED  dieu kien tien quyet thieu (GPU / dataset / ket qua tracker) - ghi ly do, KHONG chay
++    NOT_RUN  bi loai bang --only/--skip
