+++        1. metric sau lam tron (4 chu so) - muc yeu nhat
+++        2. metric DAY DU DO CHINH XAC (float64 tu raw_fields.json + combined_metrics.csv)
+++        3. TOAN BO dau ra tracking: file MOTChallenge co bit-identical khong; neu khong,
