+++"""
+++make_lock.py -- (MOC 2, muc 5) Ghi BAN KHOA cau hinh truoc khi chay tap TEST: commit, thoi diem, sha256 cua
+++tung file cau hinh (experiment + tracker yaml), tieu chi lua chon, danh sach sequence, cache meta, moi truong.
