+"""
+failure_analysis.py -- (MOC 2, muc 2) Phan tich NGUYEN NHAN mat ID quanh su kien che khuat tu LOG QUYET
+DINH GHEP cua tracker (assoc_log) + ground truth (GT CHI dung de phan tich, KHONG tham gia tracking).
